    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Fantastic Opportunity to Own a Stylish Two-Bedroom Apartment in Dublin 8. \r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike, this well-presented own door two-bedroom first-floor apartment in the popular Viking Court development offers an excellent combination of a highly convenient Dublin 8 location and the considerable benefit of a secure private parking space behind electric gates.\r\n\r\nFreshly painted throughout, the apartment is ready for its new owner to move in and make it their own. The well-designed accommodation features a bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, creating a welcoming space for both everyday living and entertaining. There are two bedrooms, comprising one double bedroom and a single bedroom, both wirh built in wardrobes and  a family bathroom featuring a bath and overhead shower.\r\n\r\nViking Court is ideally positioned on Meath Place, Dublin 8, within easy reach of Dublin city centre and surrounded by a wide range of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities. Excellent public transport links provide easy access to the city centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
